      "sections": [
        {
          "heading": "Understanding Zone 7b Climate",
          "content": "Zone 7b features an average minimum winter temperature of 5 to 10\u00b0F (-15 to -12\u00b0C), with a growing season from mid-April to mid-October. This moderate climate supports both cool-season and warm-season crops. Beginners should note frost dates for optimal planting.",
