      "content": "This record provides comprehensive guidance on designing a raised bed garden for beginners, covering ideal dimensions, design considerations, and practical tips for success. The recommendations are based on widely accepted gardening practices and aim to balance usability, cost, and plant needs.",
      "created_at": "2023-10-05T10:05:00Z",
