          "heading": "Limitations and Areas of Uncertainty",
          "content": "Many benefits like flavor enhancement are anecdotal. Pest repellency effectiveness varies by region and cultivar. Large-scale studies are lacking. Consult local agricultural extensions for region-specific data.",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "heading": "Conclusion",
          "content": "Companion planting, especially tomatoes with basil, offers pest control, space efficiency, and cultural synergy. While some benefits are unproven, the pairing is supported by traditional knowledge and preliminary research. Experimentation with spacing and additional companions is recommended.",
          "type": "text"
        }
